    <field name="scopecontent_teim">Henry Fowle Durant (Born Henry Welles Smith) (February 22, 1822 – October 3, 1881) was an American lawyer, philanthropist, and founded Wellesley College in 1870. Henry and Pauline Durant archival material can be found at Wellesley College in Wellesley, MA.</field>
